		<content type="html" xml:base="http://localhost/opengd77/viewtopic.php?t=4905&amp;p=35885#p35885"><![CDATA[
<ul><li> Updated satellite.txt file from David, N9KT.<br>    See <a href="https://www.opengd77.com/viewtopic.php?f=7&amp;t=4904&amp;p=35884#p35883" class="postlink">viewtopic.php?f=7&amp;t=4904&amp;p=35884#p35883</a><br>    To have POEM 4 TLE, url's GROUP has to be set to "active" instead of "amateur".</li><li> Fix the keps download URL storage/retrieval.<br>    Clicking CTRL+ALT while clicking the "install satellite keps" button restores the default URL.<br>    Also, if the keps download fails, the default keps URL is restored.</li></ul>The installer can be downloaded from: <a href="https://drive.proton.me/urls/43E0Z20PAR#63ZowszjWAa4" class="postlink">https://drive.proton.me/urls/43E0Z20PAR#63ZowszjWAa4</a><br><br><strong class="text-strong">NOTE</strong>: you need a firmware greater or equal to the 2025/01/26 to be able to use the Beacon Silently option.<br>For translators, CPS XML files are located at: <a href="https://drive.proton.me/urls/K6NBA7FRH0#owtc56LE34hj" class="postlink">https://drive.proton.me/urls/K6NBA7FRH0#owtc56LE34hj</a><p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=56">F1RMB</a> — Sun Feb 23, 2025 4:32 pm</p><hr />
]]></content>
